  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><size=+10>Objective</size></b>\nThe objective of Spider is to assemble
    8 complete same-suit sequences in descending order (from King down to Ace) within
    the Tableau. Once a full 13-card sequence of the same suit is completed, it is
    automatically removed from the board. \n\n<b><size=+10>Layout</size></b>\n<b>\\u2022
    Tableau:</b> The main playing area, consisting of 10 columns containing a total
    of 54 cards. The first 4 columns contain 6 cards each, while the remaining 6
    columns contain 5 cards each. Only the top card of each column begins face up.\n<b>\\u2022
    Stock:</b> The pile containing the remaining 50 cards, used to deal a new row
    of cards across all 10 Tableau columns when you run out of moves."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6622473957194473056, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
