  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '3. Clearing Completed Sets

    When you assemble a complete 13-card sequence
    of the same suit from King down to Ace, the entire stack is automatically removed
    from the Tableau.


    4. Dealing from the Stock

    As long as you have at
    least one card in every Tableau column, you may tap the Stock to deal 10 face-up
    cards into the Tableau (one per column).


    <b><size=+10>How To Win</size></b>

    You
    win the game when all cards have been cleared from the board.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
